@HobbyTracker.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5201

### Search IGDB for games by title.
# Hits IGDB, upserts every result into media + games, returns them in relevance order.
# Run it twice and the row count will not change — see the upsert note in CLAUDE.md.
GET {{HobbyTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games?search=halo
Accept: application/json

### Same search, capped to five results.
GET {{HobbyTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games?search=hollow%20knight&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### A title with no IGDB match — expect 200 and an empty array, not a 404.
GET {{HobbyTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games?search=zzzzzzzznotarealgame
Accept: application/json

### Missing search term — expect 400 with a ValidationProblemDetails body.
GET {{HobbyTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (Development only).
GET {{HobbyTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
